Resources
  ✘ repository    requires Administration: write, which cannot be granted to GITHUB_TOKEN
  ✘ topics        requires Administration: write, which cannot be granted to GITHUB_TOKEN
  ✔ labels
  ✘ autolinks     requires Administration: write, which cannot be granted to GITHUB_TOKEN
  ✘ rulesets      requires Administration: write, which cannot be granted to GITHUB_TOKEN
  ✘ environments  requires Administration: write, which cannot be granted to GITHUB_TOKEN
  ✘ actions       requires Administration: write, which cannot be granted to GITHUB_TOKEN
  ✘ variables     requires Variables: write, which cannot be granted to GITHUB_TOKEN
  ✔ pages

